This is based on version 1.2 of this program, it tests the core words of an ANS forth system.

- [****tester-2b.f****](tester-2b.f) ; Contains the Hayes tester
  fifo, and code for starting code & stopping code on the second core
- [****Core-test.f****](Core-test.f) ; Test the dpANS core words
- [****noforth-test.f****](noforth-test.f) ; Test noForth specific primitives

